meaning I read a book at school, two action words follow, first, писать, писать, it means

00:02:18.660 --> 00:02:23.280
Now for grammar Russian verbs change their endings depending on who is doing the action.

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:26.040
Take the verb читать, which means to read.

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:28.700
With я it becomes я читаю, for I read.

00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:31.220
With ты it becomes ты читаешь, for you read.

00:02:31.780 --> 00:02:35.900
With on or она it becomes on читает, or она читает, for he or she reads.

00:02:36.640 --> 00:02:41.340
These endings make it clear who is acting, much like English but with more visible patterns.

00:02:41.980 --> 00:02:45.780
