00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:21.240
There's something really cool about one of today's words that shows how

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:22.100
language is travel.

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:24.840
The word школа began in ancient Greek as

00:03:24.840 --> 00:03:27.060
школе, meaning free time for learning.

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:30.940
Это муфт рулетен into old Russian and then into modern Russian.

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:35.620
English school followed almost the same path from the same route, so the two words

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:38.020
are linguistic cousins that arrived centuries apart.

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:43.440
In some context rations also use school for any training course, just as we say driving

00:03:43.440 --> 00:03:43.860
